    {
      "type": "tweet",
      "id": "2036203355077325180",
      "url": "https://x.com/AribisalaSeyi/status/2036203355077325180",
      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/AribisalaSeyi/status/2036203355077325180",
      "text": "Guys I’m back again 😅🚗💨\n\nMake we run today’s breakdown together 👇\n\n📊 Trips: 8\n💰 Total Earnings: ₦84,400\n⛽ Fuel: Bought ₦50k (still get like 10 liters left… so roughly today na about ₦40k fuel)\n\nNow the funny (but painful) part 😂😭\n\nNa so I follow Google today like say na my village chief…\nTrip wey suppose carry me go Mega Chicken (Okita, Lekki-Epe Expressway)…\n\nBefore I know wetin dey happen, I don land for Coaster New Road 😩\nGuyyyy I drive pass 12km extra just like that 💀\nAt that moment, I just weak… I know say I don lose small today 🤦‍♂️\nBut God dey sha 🙏\nCustomer sef no stress me — even shock me pass…\nNa Philippines client wey I pick from Festac go Mega Chicken… cool and calm 🙌\nLesson of the day:\nNo trust Google 100% for Lagos ooo 😭\nSometimes ask road, sometimes trust your instinct!\n\nMake we gist 👇\n👉 You don ever follow Google enter problem before?\n👉 How you dey avoid wrong routes for Lagos?\n👉 8 trips = ₦84k… you think say today try or I for push more?\n\nDrop your thoughts my people 💬🔥",
      "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
